<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Industries started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said on Wednesday its analyst Jack Modzelewski had started coverage of U.S. Industries Inc with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Iselin, N.J., consumer and building products company opened up 1/4 to 33-3/4 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
